    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Generate your own Battle Royale simulations filled with Artificial Intelligences trained using machine learning !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is <strong>5\u00a0official maps</strong> and you can <strong>generate more than 100 million unique maps</strong> ! You can also <strong>create your own maps</strong> with the <strong>level editor</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604450/extras/a2220766261f63ca434ff8f7a6458fda.avif?t=1747697303\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Streamer Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This mode will <strong>let your Twitch.tv viewers join the battle</strong> by typing &quot;play&quot; in the chat ! This will create an AI with their name and their chosen skin !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each viewers have their own AI</strong> and are able to fight in the Battle Royale battle !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a <strong>small streamer</strong>? No worries! <strong>You can change the number of AI per viewer</strong>! From 1 to 6!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Normal Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this mode you can <strong>create and control your own IA</strong>! <strong>Level up &amp; improve your AI</strong> by winning matches and killing other IA's! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also <strong>change the appearance of your AI</strong> by opening <strong>free loot boxes</strong> you get as you level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UP TO 500 VIEWERS CAN JOIN THE MATCH !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHO WILL BE THE LAST SURVIVOR ?</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Generate your own Battle Royale simulations filled with Artificial Intelligences trained using machine learning !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There is <strong>5\u00a0official maps</strong> and you can <strong>generate more than 100 million unique maps</strong> ! You can also <strong>create your own maps</strong> with the <strong>level editor</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1604450/extras/a2220766261f63ca434ff8f7a6458fda.avif?t=1747697303\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Streamer Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This mode will <strong>let your Twitch.tv viewers join the battle</strong> by typing &quot;play&quot; in the chat ! This will create an AI with their name and their chosen skin !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Each viewers have their own AI</strong> and are able to fight in the Battle Royale battle !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a <strong>small streamer</strong>? No worries! <strong>You can change the number of AI per viewer</strong>! From 1 to 6!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The Normal Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this mode you can <strong>create and control your own IA</strong>! <strong>Level up &amp; improve your AI</strong> by winning matches and killing other IA's! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also <strong>change the appearance of your AI</strong> by opening <strong>free loot boxes</strong> you get as you level up!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UP TO 500 VIEWERS CAN JOIN THE MATCH !</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WHO WILL BE THE LAST SURVIVOR ?</strong></p>",
